      "side": 1,
      "message": "Concern with moving the CB_NULL scheduling into nfs_rpc_create_chan_v41() is that the function is also used from bind_conn_to_session_backchannel(). Triggering it there would cause a CB_NULL to be sent on every BIND_CONNECTION as well, which changes the current behavior.\n\nSince the intent of this patch is only to send the initial CB_NULL after CREATE_SESSION (to satisfy pynfs CSESS20/21 expectations), I kept the scheduling in the CREATE_SESSION path.",
